Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: buf.c
Line: 1125
Function: xmlBufferWriteQuotedString
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: The function calls xmlStrchr(string, '"') without verifying that 'string' is non-NULL. If a caller passes string == NULL, this will dereference a NULL pointer and crash.

Source context:
```c
